  "notes": [
    "You need Saints Row: The Third Remastered on Steam, the 2024-08 build (Epic and GOG are not supported; a game update can break the link), and Minecraft: Java Edition. Windows, DirectX 11.",
    "Single player only: do not join or host co-op while it is installed. Back up your saves first. Known upstream bugs: the Saints Row HUD can vanish, scopes zoom Saints Row but not Minecraft, cars brake at blocks instead of crashing, furniture can snap Steve back to the Boss.",
    "The local link has no password while Minecraft runs. Beta (\"Status: early\" upstream): report bugs to the author with the Report a bug link."
